    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's been two weeks since the funeral. the house is so quiet it actually hurts my ears. i just sit in his chair and stare at the wall for hours. i don't even know what i'm supposed to do with my hands or my time anymore. i feel like i just... evaporated. like there's nothing left of me.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
