      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's completely normal to feel this way after losing someone close. The silence and emptiness can be overwhelming, and it's as if you're still adjusting to the new reality without them. Allow yourself to feel these emotions, and don't put pressure on yourself to \"be strong\" just yet. Just take things one day at a time, and remember, grief is a process that takes time to unfold.",
